RCP 1
M title Dal tadka
M serves 4
M time 40
I 250|g|split red lentils, rinsed
I 1|tsp|turmeric
I 3|tbsp|ghee
I 1|tsp|cumin seeds
I 1|tsp|mustard seeds
I 2|clove|garlic, sliced
I 1||onion, finely chopped
I 2||tomatoes, chopped
I 1|tsp|garam masala
I ||salt, to taste
S 1200
T Simmer the lentils with the turmeric and
T a litre of water until soft, skimming
T any foam.
S 60
T Heat the ghee in a small pan and crackle
T the cumin and mustard seeds.
S 360
T Add the garlic and onion to the ghee and
T fry until golden.
S 300
T Stir in the tomatoes and garam masala
T and cook down to a jammy paste.
S 180
T Pour the tadka over the lentils, season
T with salt and simmer briefly.
